# Known test262 failures for the src/polyfills shims.
#
# One test id per line, relative to the test262 root. A line ending in `/`
# allows every test beneath that directory.
#
# The runner fails when an entry here matches no test (a rename upstream) and
# when a listed test PASSES (the entry is stale), so this file cannot quietly
# grow stale and mask a real regression.
#
# Empty is the healthy state: every shim's observable behavior matches the
# suite. Add an entry only with a comment saying why the difference is
# acceptable and what would remove it.
